<title>GERMANY: RWE, Veba plan on o.tel.o stake.</title>
<headline>RWE, Veba plan on o.tel.o stake.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veba AG and RWE AG have a long-term plan to even out their holdings in telecommunications joint venture o.tel.o, RWE chairman Dietmar Kuhnt said in a magazine interview.</p>
<p>Kuhnt told Focus magazine that Veba currently holds a 40 percent stake in the venture and RWE a 37.5 percent stake and that within the next 10 years the two diversified energy groups will hold equal shares in the venture.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
